WEBVTT

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:30.143
specializing in fossil hunting in caves

00:00:30.167 --> 00:00:32.708
in unstable, hostile
and disputed territories.

00:00:33.958 --> 00:00:37.476
And we all know that
if I was a guy and not a girl,

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:40.684
that wouldn't be a job description,
that would be a pick-up line.

00:00:40.708 --> 00:00:42.893
(Laughter)

00:00:42.917 --> 00:00:45.351
Now, here's the thing.
I do not have a death wish.

00:00:45.375 --> 00:00:47.518
I'm not an adrenaline junkie.

00:00:47.542 --> 00:00:50.059
I just looked at a map.

00:00:50.083 --> 00:00:54.309
See, frontline exploratory science
does not happen as much

00:00:54.333 --> 00:00:56.833
